          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, micro-Si, at regional storage
na;
UUID: a1284270-58c3-3780-8c18-8a53dcd7d9c5
Main production takes place in China. Transport from Shanghai (20000 km) to Rotterdam is included. Transport from Rotterdam to the regional storage takes into account the three main producers of solar power in Europe (Italy, Germany and Spain). The transport distance is 940 km.; Geography: Europe
